    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "+2=2\nROME\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nROME, the Eternal City, is rich in artistic treasures. 2500 years of history lives on in the glorious\nmonuments, churches and ruins. The Roman Forum, the Colosseum, the Vatican, St. Peter's, the\nSistine Chapel, the Pantheon, the Spanish Steps, Trevi Fountain are just a few. History is Rome's forte\nbut the shops, food, wine, and the friendly people are renowned throughout the world. Pan Am\nserves Rome every day directly from New York and Los Angeles.\nOPAN AM.",
      "Fist Class Menus\nLibationdo\nSherry\nDubonnet Campari\nManhattan\nGin Martini Vodka Martini\nVermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum Premium Beer\nCoffee\nDelectationso\nTropical Fruit Medley\nSun drenched sweet ripe pineapple and orange supremes.\nA fluffy omelet envelops a hearty filling of sauteed\npeppers and onions in a tangy tomato sauce\nServed with lean grilled Canadian bacon and butter baked Becky potatoes\nEgg Diable\nFresh eggs nestled in ripe tomato halves with a bubbling cheese topping\nServed with crisply broiled bacon and potato rounds\nbaked together golden brown.\nBakery Fresh Croissant and Blueberry Cheese Danish\nCreamery Butter and Boysenberry Preserves\nTea\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nSelected Red and White Wines\nChampagne Brut\nDrambuie\nBénédictine\nCrème de Menthe\nCognac Napoléon Contreau Kahlúa\nAmaretto di Saronno\nD2154\n2001.080.024"
    ],
